  "releaseNotes": "- Fix handshake byte loss when the server sends the first WebSocket frame in the same TCP segment as the HTTP 101 response.\n- Reduce per-frame send allocations by generating masking keys on the stack.\n- Read frame payloads directly into owned buffers instead of rent-and-copy from ArrayPool.",
